┌ certtui ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│┌ Help · j/k scroll · Esc closes ────────────────────────────────────────────┐│
││Keys                                                                        ││
││  j / ↓         move down                                                   ││
││  k / ↑         move up                                                     ││
││  l / Tab       next pane                                                   ││
││  h / Shift-Tab previous pane                                               ││
││  ]             next tab                                                    ││
││  [             previous tab                                                ││
││  Enter         open / confirm                                              ││
││  Esc           back, cancel, stop typing                                   ││
││  o             enter a new target                                          ││
││  r             inspect again (not yet)                                     ││
││  x             cycle fingerprint format                                    ││
││  f             favorite the target (not yet)                               ││
││  /             filter rows (not yet)                                       ││
││  s             sort rows (not yet)                                         ││
││  e             export to a file (not yet)                                  ││
││  y             copy the field under the cursor                             ││
││  Y             copy the visible tab as text                                ││
││  c             copy the certificate as PEM                                 ││
││  C             copy the whole chain as PEM                                 ││
│└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘│
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
